  "description": "Operating Area: South of France, Corsica and Sardinia\n\nAlmaju is that moment when time slows down… and everything becomes simpler.\n\nOn board the Absolute 60 Fly, the sun glides gently over the water, the sea stretches as far as the eye can see, and every moment is savored in a new way. A coffee overlooking the horizon, a burst of laughter on the flybridge, an evening that lingers under the stars.\n\nHere, you forget the rhythm of daily life. You let yourself be carried away, you breathe, you enjoy.\n\nAlmaju is not just a yacht, it is a parenthesis outside of time, an invitation to experience the sea differently.",
